    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="4" level="1"><dynexp formula="t_cov = 0.25 in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input"><expbody>t_cov = 0.25 in</expbody></dynexp><break type="tab"/>Top and bottom cover layer thickness</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="4" level="1"><dynexp formula="alpha_t = 0.000006" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input"><expbody>alpha_t = 0.000006</expbody></dynexp><break type="tab"/>Coefficient of thermal expansion (per °F)</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="4" level="1"><dynexp formula="dT = 35" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input"><expbody>dT = 35</expbody></dynexp><break type="tab"/>Temperature fall from 70 °F mean (°F)</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="L_exp = 107.35 ft" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input">
        <expbody>L_exp = 107.35 ft</expbody>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Expansion length to the movement center at the pier</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="4" level="1"><dynexp formula="eps_sh = 0.000073" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input"><expbody>eps_sh = 0.000073</expbody></dynexp><break type="tab"/>Beam shrinkage strain after bearing seating</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="3" fontweight="bold" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">Tie-back strap and cheek-wall wind</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="4" level="1"><dynexp formula="z_strap = 1.5 ft" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input"><expbody>z_strap = 1.5 ft</expbody></dynexp><break type="tab"/>Tie-back strap elevation above the cap top</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="4" level="1"><dynexp formula="V_III = 130" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input"><expbody>V_III = 130</expbody></dynexp><break type="tab"/>Strength III design wind speed (mph)</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="4" level="1"><dynexp formula="V_SER = 70" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input"><expbody>V_SER = 70</expbody></dynexp><break type="tab"/>Service I wind speed (mph)</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="K_Z_III = 1.02" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input">
        <expbody>K_Z_III = 1.02</expbody>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Strength III pressure exposure and elevation coefficient</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="K_Z_SER = 1" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input">
        <expbody>K_Z_SER = 1</expbody>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Service I pressure exposure and elevation coefficient</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="4" level="1"><dynexp formula="G_w = 0.85" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input"><expbody>G_w = 0.85</expbody></dynexp><break type="tab"/>Gust effect factor</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="4" level="1"><dynexp formula="C_D = 1.6" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input"><expbody>C_D = 1.6</expbody></dynexp><break type="tab"/>Drag coefficient, substructure</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="3" fontweight="bold" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">Reinforcement (trial) and cover (SDG Table 1.4.2-1)</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="4" level="1"><dynexp formula="cv_bw = 3 in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input"><expbody>cv_bw = 3 in</expbody></dynexp><break type="tab"/>Backwall clear cover, both faces</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="4" level="1"><dynexp formula="cv_ck = 2 in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input"><expbody>cv_ck = 2 in</expbody></dynexp><break type="tab"/>Cheek wall clear cover, both faces</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="4" level="1"><dynexp formula="bar_FF = 5" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input"><expbody>bar_FF = 5</expbody></dynexp><break type="tab"/>Backwall vertical bar · fill face</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="4" level="1"><dynexp formula="s_FF = 12 in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input"><expbody>s_FF = 12 in</expbody></dynexp><break type="tab"/>Backwall vertical spacing · fill face</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="4" level="1"><dynexp formula="bar_SF = 5" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input"><expbody>bar_SF = 5</expbody></dynexp><break type="tab"/>Backwall vertical bar · span face</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="4" level="1"><dynexp formula="s_SF = 12 in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input"><expbody>s_SF = 12 in</expbody></dynexp><break type="tab"/>Backwall vertical spacing · span face</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="4" level="1"><dynexp formula="bar_HZ = 4" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input"><expbody>bar_HZ = 4</expbody></dynexp><break type="tab"/>Backwall horizontal bar · each face</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="4" level="1"><dynexp formula="s_HZ = 12 in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input"><expbody>s_HZ = 12 in</expbody></dynexp><break type="tab"/>Backwall horizontal spacing · each face</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="4" level="1"><dynexp formula="bar_CK = 4" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input"><expbody>bar_CK = 4</expbody></dynexp><break type="tab"/>Cheek wall vertical bar · single mat</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="4" level="1"><dynexp formula="s_CK = 10 in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input"><expbody>s_CK = 10 in</expbody></dynexp><break type="tab"/>Cheek wall vertical spacing · single mat</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="4" level="1"><dynexp formula="bar_CKH = 4" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input"><expbody>bar_CKH = 4</expbody></dynexp><break type="tab"/>Cheek wall horizontal bar · single mat</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="4" level="1"><dynexp formula="s_CKH = 10 in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input"><expbody>s_CKH = 10 in</expbody></dynexp><break type="tab"/>Cheek wall horizontal spacing · single mat</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="3" fontweight="bold" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">Materials and resistance factors</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="4" level="1"><dynexp formula="fc = 5.5 ksi" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input"><expbody>fc = 5.5 ksi</expbody></dynexp><break type="tab"/>Concrete compressive strength</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="4" level="1"><dynexp formula="fy = 60 ksi" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input"><expbody>fy = 60 ksi</expbody></dynexp><break type="tab"/>Reinforcement yield strength (A615 Grade 60)</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="4" level="1"><dynexp formula="Es = 29000 ksi" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input"><expbody>Es = 29000 ksi</expbody></dynexp><break type="tab"/>Reinforcement modulus</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="4" level="1"><dynexp formula="w_c = 0.15 kip/ft^3" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input"><expbody>w_c = 0.15 kip/ft^3</expbody></dynexp><break type="tab"/>Reinforced concrete unit weight</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="w_cE = 0.1455 kip/ft^3" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input">
        <expbody>w_cE = 0.1455 kip/ft^3</expbody>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Plain concrete unit weight for the elastic modulus</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="4" level="1"><dynexp formula="K_1 = 1" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input"><expbody>K_1 = 1</expbody></dynexp><break type="tab"/>Aggregate correction factor</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="4" level="1"><dynexp formula="λ = 1" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input"><expbody>λ = 1</expbody></dynexp><break type="tab"/>Concrete density modification factor</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="φ_f = 0.9" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input">
        <expbody>φ_f = 0.9</expbody>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Flexural resistance factor (tension controlled)</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="4" level="1"><dynexp formula="φ_v = 0.9" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input"><expbody>φ_v = 0.9</expbody></dynexp><break type="tab"/>Shear resistance factor</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="4" level="1"><dynexp formula="γ_e = 1" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input"><expbody>γ_e = 1</expbody></dynexp><break type="tab"/>Crack-control exposure factor (Class 1)</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="4" level="1"><dynexp formula="fss_ratio = 0.8" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input"><expbody>fss_ratio = 0.8</expbody></dynexp><break type="tab"/>Service stress limit as a fraction of fy</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="4" level="1"><dynexp formula="gamma_1 = 1.6" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input"><expbody>gamma_1 = 1.6</expbody></dynexp><break type="tab"/>Flexural cracking variability factor</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="gamma_3 = 0.67" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input">
        <expbody>gamma_3 = 0.67</expbody>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Yield-to-ultimate ratio factor (A615 Grade 60)</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="beta_v = 2" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input">
        <expbody>beta_v = 2</expbody>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Simplified shear β (overall depth below 16 in)</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="c_if = 0.075 ksi" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input">
        <expbody>c_if = 0.075 ksi</expbody>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Interface cohesion, clean joint not intentionally roughened</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="4" level="1"><dynexp formula="mu_if = 0.6" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input"><expbody>mu_if = 0.6</expbody></dynexp><break type="tab"/>Interface friction factor</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="4" level="1"><dynexp formula="K1_if = 0.2" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input"><expbody>K1_if = 0.2</expbody></dynexp><break type="tab"/>Interface strength fraction K1</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="4" level="1"><dynexp formula="K2_if = 0.8 ksi" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input"><expbody>K2_if = 0.8 ksi</expbody></dynexp><break type="tab"/>Interface limiting stress K2</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="Ab(k) = If(k == 3, 0.11 in^2, If(k == 4, 0.2 in^2, If(k == 5, 0.31 in^2, If(k == 6, 0.44 in^2, If(k == 7, 0.6 in^2, If(k == 8, 0.79 in^2, If(k == 9, 1 in^2, If(k == 10, 1.27 in^2, If(k == 11, 1.56 in^2, 0 in^2)))))))))" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>Ab(k) = If(k == 3, 0.11 in^2, If(k == 4, 0.2 in^2, If(k == 5, 0.31 in^2, If(k == 6, 0.44 in^2, If(k == 7, 0.6 in^2, If(k == 8, 0.79 in^2, If(k == 9, 1 in^2, If(k == 10, 1.27 in^2, If(k == 11, 1.56 in^2, 0 in^2)))))))))</expbody>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">bar area by bar number</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="Db(k) = If(k == 3, 0.375 in, If(k == 4, 0.5 in, If(k == 5, 0.625 in, If(k == 6, 0.75 in, If(k == 7, 0.875 in, If(k == 8, 1 in, If(k == 9, 1.128 in, If(k == 10, 1.27 in, If(k == 11, 1.41 in, 0 in)))))))))" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>Db(k) = If(k == 3, 0.375 in, If(k == 4, 0.5 in, If(k == 5, 0.625 in, If(k == 6, 0.75 in, If(k == 7, 0.875 in, If(k == 8, 1 in, If(k == 9, 1.128 in, If(k == 10, 1.27 in, If(k == 11, 1.41 in, 0 in)))))))))</expbody>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">bar diameter by bar number</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="14" spacingafter="6" fontweight="bold" textcolor="#1766A0" spacingbefore="8" keepwithnext="True" pagebreakbefore="break">3. Geometry and overturning arms</paragraph>
    <embed spacingbefore="4" spacingafter="5">
      <canvas name="Figure1Section" title="End-bent section" unit="in" size="6.5 in; 5.6 in; scaletofit">
        <include target="Library.Geometry"/>
        <planecontainer origin="0.15,5.35,0" dir="1,0,0" normal="0,0,1" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="9" textcolor="#29333D">
          <textvalue>END-BENT SECTION: LOADS, ARMS AND HEIGHTS</textvalue>
        </planecontainer>
        <plot formula="PlotLines([1,2.809,2.809,1,1],[1.436,1.436,4.555,4.555,1.436])" linecolor="#7B8993" linethickness="0.9"/>
        <planecontainer origin="1.353,4.087,0" dir="1,0,0" normal="0,0,1" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="8" textcolor="#7B8993">
          <textvalue>MSE fill</textvalue>
        </planecontainer>
        <plot formula="PlotLines([1,3.25,3.25,1,1],[4.555,4.555,4.702,4.702,4.555])" linecolor="#7B8993" linethickness="1"/>
        <planecontainer origin="1.066,4.742,0" dir="1,0,0" normal="0,0,1" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="8" textcolor="#7B8993">
          <textvalue>landing slab</textvalue>
        </planecontainer>
        <plot formula="PlotLines([3.515,5.478,5.478,3.515,3.515],[3.074,3.074,5.112,5.112,3.074])" linecolor="#7B8993" linethickness="0.7"/>
        <planecontainer origin="5.037,4.972,0" dir="1,0,0" normal="0,0,1" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="8" textcolor="#7B8993">
          <textvalue>beam</textvalue>
        </planecontainer>
        <plot formula="PlotLines([2.809,4.353,4.353,2.809,2.809],[2.759,2.759,4.979,4.979,2.759])" linecolor="#7B8993" linethickness="0.6"/>
        <planecontainer origin="1.709,4.879,0" dir="1,0,0" normal="0,0,1" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="8" textcolor="#7B8993">
          <textvalue>cheek wall (behind)</textvalue>
        </planecontainer>
        <plot formula="PlotLines([3.25,3.912,3.912,3.25,3.25],[0.553,0.553,1.877,1.877,0.553])" linecolor="#7B8993" linethickness="0.9"/>
        <plot formula="PlotLines([2.809,4.353,4.353,2.809,2.809],[1.436,1.436,2.759,2.759,1.436])" linecolor="#29333D" linethickness="1.8"/>
        <plot formula="PlotLines([2.809,3.25,3.25,2.809,2.809],[2.759,2.759,4.555,4.555,2.759])" linecolor="#29333D" linethickness="1.8"/>
        <plot formula="PlotLines([3.25,4.353,4.353,3.25,3.25],[2.759,2.759,2.98,2.98,2.759])" linecolor="#29333D" linethickness="1"/>
        <plot formula="PlotLines([3.507,3.875,3.875,3.507,3.507],[2.98,2.98,3.074,3.074,2.98])" linecolor="#29333D" linethickness="1.6"/>
        <planecontainer origin="2.875,1.674,0" dir="1,0,0" normal="0,0,1" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="8" textcolor="#7B8993">
          <textvalue>cap</textvalue>
        </planecontainer>
        <planecontainer origin="2.844,4.375,0" dir="1,0,0" normal="0,0,1" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="8" textcolor="#7B8993">
          <textvalue>backwall</textvalue>
        </planecontainer>
        <plot formula="PlotLines([1,5.5],[1.877,1.877])" linecolor="#7B8993" linethickness="0.7"/>
        <planecontainer origin="4.95,1.917,0" dir="1,0,0" normal="0,0,1" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="8" textcolor="#7B8993">
          <textvalue>pile top</textvalue>
        </planecontainer>
        <plot formula="PlotLines([3.471,3.471],[0.266,2.803])" linecolor="#1766A0" linethickness="0.9"/>
        <plot formula="PlotLines([3.581,3.581],[0.266,1.413])" linecolor="#7B8993" linethickness="0.7"/>
        <circle center="3.471, 1.877, 0" normal="0, 0, 1" radius="0.06" linethickness="1.4" linecolor="#1766A0" fillcolor="#FFFFFF"/>
        <planecontainer origin="3.271,1.737,0" dir="1,0,0" normal="0,0,1" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="9" textcolor="#1766A0">
          <textvalue>O</textvalue>
        </planecontainer>
        <planecontainer origin="2.471,0.209,0" dir="1,0,0" normal="0,0,1" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="8" textcolor="#1766A0">
          <textvalue>shifted pile line</textvalue>
        </planecontainer>
        <planecontainer origin="3.641,0.209,0" dir="1,0,0" normal="0,0,1" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="8" textcolor="#7B8993">
          <textvalue>pile</textvalue>
        </planecontainer>
        <plot formula="PlotLines([2.213,2.799],[2.475,2.475])" linecolor="#B35012" linethickness="1.6"/>
        <plot formula="PlotLines([2.709,2.799,2.709],[2.432,2.475,2.519])" linecolor="#B35012" linethickness="1.6"/>
        <planecontainer origin="2.213,2.525,0" dir="1,0,0" normal="0,0,1" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="8" textcolor="#B35012">
          <textvalue>F_EH</textvalue>
        </planecontainer>
        <plot formula="PlotLines([2.213,2.799],[2.995,2.995])" linecolor="#B35012" linethickness="1.6"/>
        <plot formula="PlotLines([2.709,2.799,2.709],[2.952,2.995,3.039])" linecolor="#B35012" linethickness="1.6"/>
        <planecontainer origin="2.213,3.045,0" dir="1,0,0" normal="0,0,1" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="8" textcolor="#B35012">
          <textvalue>F_ES, F_LS</textvalue>
        </planecontainer>
        <plot formula="PlotLines([2.809,2.147],[3.421,3.421])" linecolor="#167B75" linethickness="2"/>
        <plot formula="PlotLines([2.237,2.147,2.237],[3.465,3.421,3.378])" linecolor="#167B75" linethickness="2"/>
        <planecontainer origin="2.147,3.471,0" dir="1,0,0" normal="0,0,1" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="8" textcolor="#167B75">
          <textvalue>F_str (strap)</textvalue>
        </planecontainer>
        <plot formula="PlotLines([3.905,4.455],[3.027,3.027])" linecolor="#B35012" linethickness="1.6"/>
        <plot formula="PlotLines([4.365,4.455,4.365],[2.984,3.027,3.071])" linecolor="#B35012" linethickness="1.6"/>
        <planecontainer origin="3.925,2.877,0" dir="1,0,0" normal="0,0,1" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="8" textcolor="#B35012">
          <textvalue>F_TU, F_SH, H_WS</textvalue>
        </planecontainer>
        <plot formula="PlotLines([3.691,3.691],[5.068,3.084])" linecolor="#C8702A" linethickness="1.6"/>
        <plot formula="PlotLines([3.648,3.691,3.735],[3.174,3.084,3.174])" linecolor="#C8702A" linethickness="1.6"/>
        <planecontainer origin="3.751,4.968,0" dir="1,0,0" normal="0,0,1" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="8" textcolor="#C8702A">
          <textvalue>W_DCb, W_PLb</textvalue>
        </planecontainer>
        <circle center="3.581, 2.097, 0" normal="0, 0, 1" radius="0.035" linethickness="0.5" linecolor="#C8702A" fillcolor="#C8702A"/>
        <plot formula="PlotLines([3.581,3.581],[2.477,2.137])" linecolor="#C8702A" linethickness="1.4"/>
        <plot formula="PlotLines([3.546,3.581,3.616],[2.209,2.137,2.209])" linecolor="#C8702A" linethickness="1.4"/>
        <planecontainer origin="3.651,2.397,0" dir="1,0,0" normal="0,0,1" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="8" textcolor="#C8702A">
          <textvalue>W_cap</textvalue>
        </planecontainer>
        <circle center="3.802, 2.87, 0" normal="0, 0, 1" radius="0.035" linethickness="0.5" linecolor="#C8702A" fillcolor="#C8702A"/>
        <plot formula="PlotLines([3.802,3.802],[3.25,2.91])" linecolor="#C8702A" linethickness="1.4"/>
        <plot formula="PlotLines([3.767,3.802,3.836],[2.982,2.91,2.982])" linecolor="#C8702A" linethickness="1.4"/>
        <planecontainer origin="3.872,3.17,0" dir="1,0,0" normal="0,0,1" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="8" textcolor="#C8702A">
          <textvalue>W_ped</textvalue>
        </planecontainer>
        <circle center="3.029, 3.657, 0" normal="0, 0, 1" radius="0.035" linethickness="0.5" linecolor="#C8702A" fillcolor="#C8702A"/>
        <plot formula="PlotLines([3.029,3.029],[4.037,3.697])" linecolor="#C8702A" linethickness="1.4"/>
        <plot formula="PlotLines([2.995,3.029,3.064],[3.769,3.697,3.769])" linecolor="#C8702A" linethickness="1.4"/>
        <planecontainer origin="3.099,3.957,0" dir="1,0,0" normal="0,0,1" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="8" textcolor="#C8702A">
          <textvalue>W_bw</textvalue>
        </planecontainer>
        <circle center="3.501, 4.136, 0" normal="0, 0, 1" radius="0.035" linethickness="0.5" linecolor="#C8702A" fillcolor="#C8702A"/>
        <plot formula="PlotLines([3.501,3.501],[4.516,4.176])" linecolor="#C8702A" linethickness="1.4"/>
        <plot formula="PlotLines([3.466,3.501,3.535],[4.248,4.176,4.248])" linecolor="#C8702A" linethickness="1.4"/>
        <planecontainer origin="3.571,4.436,0" dir="1,0,0" normal="0,0,1" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="8" textcolor="#C8702A">
          <textvalue>W_ck</textvalue>
        </planecontainer>
        <plot formula="PlotLines([3.029,3.029],[1.427,1.202])" linecolor="#1766A0" linethickness="0.5"/>
        <lineardim startpoint="3.471, 1.237, 0" endpoint="3.029, 1.237, 0" pointondimline="3.25, 1.237, 0" formula="EndBentBackwallDesign.x_bw" linecolor="#1766A0" textcolor="#1766A0" linethickness="0.7" fontsize="8">
          <num>-12.000 in</num>
        </lineardim>
        <planecontainer origin="3.531,1.197,0" dir="1,0,0" normal="0,0,1" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="8" textcolor="#1766A0">
          <textvalue>x_bw</textvalue>
        </planecontainer>
        <plot formula="PlotLines([3.501,3.501],[1.427,1.003])" linecolor="#1766A0" linethickness="0.5"/>
        <lineardim startpoint="3.471, 1.038, 0" endpoint="3.501, 1.038, 0" pointondimline="3.486, 1.038, 0" formula="EndBentBackwallDesign.x_ck" linecolor="#1766A0" textcolor="#1766A0" linethickness="0.7" fontsize="8">
          <num>0.817 in</num>
        </lineardim>
        <planecontainer origin="3.561,0.998,0" dir="1,0,0" normal="0,0,1" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="8" textcolor="#1766A0">
          <textvalue>x_ck</textvalue>
        </planecontainer>
        <plot formula="PlotLines([3.581,3.581],[1.427,0.805])" linecolor="#1766A0" linethickness="0.5"/>
        <lineardim startpoint="3.471, 0.84, 0" endpoint="3.581, 0.84, 0" pointondimline="3.526, 0.84, 0" formula="EndBentBackwallDesign.x_cap" linecolor="#1766A0" textcolor="#1766A0" linethickness="0.7" fontsize="8">
          <num>3.000 in</num>
        </lineardim>
        <planecontainer origin="3.641,0.8,0" dir="1,0,0" normal="0,0,1" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="8" textcolor="#1766A0">
          <textvalue>x_cap</textvalue>
        </planecontainer>
        <plot formula="PlotLines([3.691,3.691],[1.427,0.606])" linecolor="#1766A0" linethickness="0.5"/>
        <lineardim startpoint="3.471, 0.641, 0" endpoint="3.691, 0.641, 0" pointondimline="3.581, 0.641, 0" formula="EndBentBackwallDesign.x_brg" linecolor="#1766A0" textcolor="#1766A0" linethickness="0.7" fontsize="8">
          <num>6.000 in</num>
        </lineardim>
        <planecontainer origin="3.751,0.601,0" dir="1,0,0" normal="0,0,1" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="8" textcolor="#1766A0">
          <textvalue>x_brg</textvalue>
        </planecontainer>
        <plot formula="PlotLines([3.802,3.802],[1.427,0.407])" linecolor="#1766A0" linethickness="0.5"/>
        <lineardim startpoint="3.471, 0.443, 0" endpoint="3.802, 0.443, 0" pointondimline="3.636, 0.443, 0" formula="EndBentBackwallDesign.x_ped" linecolor="#1766A0" textcolor="#1766A0" linethickness="0.7" fontsize="8">
          <num>9.000 in</num>
        </lineardim>
        <planecontainer origin="3.862,0.403,0" dir="1,0,0" normal="0,0,1" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="8" textcolor="#1766A0">
          <textvalue>x_ped</textvalue>
        </planecontainer>
        <lineardim startpoint="2.059, 1.877, 0" endpoint="2.059, 2.475, 0" pointondimline="2.059, 2.176, 0" formula="EndBentBackwallDesign.y_EH" linecolor="#1766A0" textcolor="#1766A0" linethickness="0.7" fontsize="8">
          <num>1.356 ft</num>
        </lineardim>
        <planecontainer origin="1.919,1.727,0" dir="1,0,0" normal="0,0,1" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="8" textcolor="#1766A0">
          <textvalue>y_EH</textvalue>
        </planecontainer>
        <lineardim startpoint="1.529, 1.877, 0" endpoint="1.529, 3.421, 0" pointondimline="1.529, 2.649, 0" formula="EndBentBackwallDesign.y_strap" linecolor="#1766A0" textcolor="#1766A0" linethickness="0.7" fontsize="8">
          <num>3.500 ft</num>
        </lineardim>
        <planecontainer origin="1.389,1.727,0" dir="1,0,0" normal="0,0,1" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="8" textcolor="#1766A0">
          <textvalue>y_strap</textvalue>
        </planecontainer>
        <lineardim startpoint="1.132, 1.436, 0" endpoint="1.132, 4.555, 0" pointondimline="1.132, 2.995, 0" formula="EndBentBackwallDesign.H_ret" linecolor="#1766A0" textcolor="#1766A0" linethickness="0.7" fontsize="8">
          <num>7.069 ft</num>
        </lineardim>
        <planecontainer origin="0.992,1.286,0" dir="1,0,0" normal="0,0,1" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="8" textcolor="#1766A0">
          <textvalue>H_ret</textvalue>
        </planecontainer>
        <lineardim startpoint="4.684, 1.877, 0" endpoint="4.684, 3.074, 0" pointondimline="4.684, 2.475, 0" formula="EndBentBackwallDesign.y_brg" linecolor="#1766A0" textcolor="#1766A0" linethickness="0.7" fontsize="8">
          <num>2.714 ft</num>
        </lineardim>
        <planecontainer origin="4.544,1.727,0" dir="1,0,0" normal="0,0,1" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="8" textcolor="#1766A0">
          <textvalue>y_brg</textvalue>
        </planecontainer>
        <plot formula="PlotLines([3.25,5.236],[4.555,4.555])" linecolor="#1766A0" linethickness="0.5"/>
        <lineardim startpoint="5.192, 2.759, 0" endpoint="5.192, 4.555, 0" pointondimline="5.192, 3.657, 0" formula="EndBentBackwallDesign.H_bw" linecolor="#1766A0" textcolor="#1766A0" linethickness="0.7" fontsize="8">
          <num>4.069 ft</num>
        </lineardim>
        <planecontainer origin="5.052,2.609,0" dir="1,0,0" normal="0,0,1" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="8" textcolor="#1766A0">
          <textvalue>H_bw</textvalue>
        </planecontainer>
      </canvas>
    </embed>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Figure 1. End-bent section. Arms are measured from O, the pile top on the pile line shifted 3 in toward the fill; x is positive toward the span and y is the height above O.</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Key: F_EH, F_ES and F_LS are the earth, slab and pedestrian surcharge resultants; F_str is the tie-back strap force; F_TU, F_SH and H_WS are the pad shear and the longitudinal wind; W_DCb and W_PLb are the superstructure and pedestrian loads; W_cap, W_ped, W_bw and W_ck are the self-weights. The blue dimensions are the arms x from the shifted pile line and the heights y above O; their values are live.</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="b_s = 12 in to in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>b_s = 12 in to in</expbody>
        <expresult> = 12.000 in</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">design strip width</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="y_top = h_cap - embed_pile to ft" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>y_top = h_cap - embed_pile to ft</expbody>
        <expresult> = 2.000 ft</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">cap top above O</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="H_ret = H_bw + h_cap to ft" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>H_ret = H_bw + h_cap to ft</expbody>
        <expresult> = 7.069 ft</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">retained height, soffit to crown</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="H_bw_avg = If(V_bw &gt; 0 ft^3, V_bw/(t_bw*L_bw), (H_bw + H_bw_edge)/2) to ft" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>H_bw_avg = If(V_bw &gt; 0 ft^3, V_bw/(t_bw*L_bw), (H_bw + H_bw_edge)/2) to ft</expbody>
        <expresult> = 3.971 ft</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">average backwall height</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="y_brg = y_top + h_ped + t_pad to ft" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>y_brg = y_top + h_ped + t_pad to ft</expbody>
        <expresult> = 2.714 ft</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">top of pad above O</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="y_strap = y_top + z_strap to ft" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>y_strap = y_top + z_strap to ft</expbody>
        <expresult> = 3.500 ft</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">strap above O</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="x_brg = e_brg + tol_pile to in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>x_brg = e_brg + tol_pile to in</expbody>
        <expresult> = 6.000 in</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">bearing arm</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="x_cap = tol_pile to in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>x_cap = tol_pile to in</expbody>
        <expresult> = 3.000 in</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">cap arm (cap centered on nominal pile)</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="x_ped = t_bw + L_ped/2 - b_cap/2 + tol_pile to in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>x_ped = t_bw + L_ped/2 - b_cap/2 + tol_pile to in</expbody>
        <expresult> = 9.000 in</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">pedestal arm</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="x_ck = dx_ck + tol_pile to in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>x_ck = dx_ck + tol_pile to in</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.817 in</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">cheek wall arm</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="x_bw = t_bw/2 - b_cap/2 + tol_pile to in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>x_bw = t_bw/2 - b_cap/2 + tol_pile to in</expbody>
        <expresult> = -12.000 in</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">backwall arm (negative = stabilizing)</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="14" spacingafter="6" fontweight="bold" textcolor="#1766A0" spacingbefore="8" keepwithnext="True">4. Loads</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="12" spacingafter="6" fontweight="bold" textcolor="#1766A0" spacingbefore="6" keepwithnext="True">4.1 Earth pressure and surcharges (LRFD 3.11.5.3 Coulomb; 3.11.6.1 uniform surcharge)</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="Gamma_c = (1 + Sqrt(Sin(phi_soil + delta_w)*Sin(phi_soil - beta_f)/(Sin(theta_w - delta_w)*Sin(theta_w + beta_f))))^2" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>Gamma_c = (1 + Sqrt(Sin(phi_soil + delta_w)*Sin(phi_soil - beta_f)/(Sin(theta_w - delta_w)*Sin(theta_w + beta_f))))^2</expbody>
        <expresult> = 2.250</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Coulomb Γ</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="k_a = Sin(theta_w + phi_soil)^2/(Gamma_c*Sin(theta_w)^2*Sin(theta_w - delta_w))" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>k_a = Sin(theta_w + phi_soil)^2/(Gamma_c*Sin(theta_w)^2*Sin(theta_w - delta_w))</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.333</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">active pressure coefficient</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="p_EH = k_a*gamma_s*H_ret to psf" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>p_EH = k_a*gamma_s*H_ret to psf</expbody>
        <expresult> = 270.984 psf</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">EH pressure at the cap soffit</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="F_EH = 0.5*k_a*gamma_s*H_ret^2*L_load to kip" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>F_EH = 0.5*k_a*gamma_s*H_ret^2*L_load to kip</expbody>
        <expresult> = 20.034 kip</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">EH resultant</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="y_EH = H_ret/3 - embed_pile to ft" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>y_EH = H_ret/3 - embed_pile to ft</expbody>
        <expresult> = 1.356 ft</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">EH height above O</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="p_LS = k_a*q_PL to psf" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>p_LS = k_a*q_PL to psf</expbody>
        <expresult> = 30.000 psf</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">pedestrian surcharge pressure</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="F_LS = p_LS*H_ret*L_load to kip" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>F_LS = p_LS*H_ret*L_load to kip</expbody>
        <expresult> = 4.436 kip</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">LS resultant</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="y_LS = H_ret/2 - embed_pile to ft" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>y_LS = H_ret/2 - embed_pile to ft</expbody>
        <expresult> = 2.535 ft</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">LS height above O</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="q_ES = t_slab*w_c to psf" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>q_ES = t_slab*w_c to psf</expbody>
        <expresult> = 50.000 psf</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">landing slab weight on the fill</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="p_ES = k_a*q_ES to psf" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>p_ES = k_a*q_ES to psf</expbody>
        <expresult> = 16.667 psf</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">slab surcharge pressure</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="F_ES = p_ES*H_ret*L_load to kip" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>F_ES = p_ES*H_ret*L_load to kip</expbody>
        <expresult> = 2.464 kip</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ES resultant</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="y_ES = H_ret/2 - embed_pile to ft" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>y_ES = H_ret/2 - embed_pile to ft</expbody>
        <expresult> = 2.535 ft</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ES height above O</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="12" spacingafter="6" fontweight="bold" textcolor="#1766A0" spacingbefore="6" keepwithnext="True">4.2 Bearing and superstructure actions (FBMP reactions; LRFD 14.6.3.1 pad shear with upper-bound G)</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="A_pad = L_pad*W_pad to in^2" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>A_pad = L_pad*W_pad to in^2</expbody>
        <expresult> = 320.000 in^2</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">pad plan area</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="h_rt = n_int*t_int + 2*t_cov to in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>h_rt = n_int*t_int + 2*t_cov to in</expbody>
        <expresult> = 2.000 in</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">elastomer thickness</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="K_pad = G_fac*G_pad*A_pad/h_rt to kip/in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>K_pad = G_fac*G_pad*A_pad/h_rt to kip/in</expbody>
        <expresult> = 20.240 kip/in</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">pad shear stiffness</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="Delta_TU = alpha_t*dT*L_exp to in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>Delta_TU = alpha_t*dT*L_exp to in</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.271 in</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">temperature fall shortening</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="F_TU = N_brg*K_pad*Delta_TU to kip" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>F_TU = N_brg*K_pad*Delta_TU to kip</expbody>
        <expresult> = 10.951 kip</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">pad shear, toward the span</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="Delta_SH = eps_sh*L_exp to in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>Delta_SH = eps_sh*L_exp to in</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.094 in</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">shrinkage shortening</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="F_SH = N_brg*K_pad*Delta_SH to kip" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>F_SH = N_brg*K_pad*Delta_SH to kip</expbody>
        <expresult> = 3.807 kip</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">pad shear, toward the span</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="W_DCb = N_brg*P_DC to kip" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>W_DCb = N_brg*P_DC to kip</expbody>
        <expresult> = 184.140 kip</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">superstructure DC</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="W_PLb = N_brg*P_PL to kip" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>W_PLb = N_brg*P_PL to kip</expbody>
        <expresult> = 57.960 kip</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">pedestrian load</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="H_WS1 = N_brg*FY_WS1 to kip" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>H_WS1 = N_brg*FY_WS1 to kip</expbody>
        <expresult> = 6.580 kip</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">longitudinal wind, Strength III dir. 1</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="H_WS2 = N_brg*FY_WS2 to kip" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>H_WS2 = N_brg*FY_WS2 to kip</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.000 kip</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">longitudinal wind, Strength III dir. 2</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="H_WS3 = N_brg*FY_WS3 to kip" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>H_WS3 = N_brg*FY_WS3 to kip</expbody>
        <expresult> = 3.260 kip</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">longitudinal wind, Service I</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="12" spacingafter="6" fontweight="bold" textcolor="#1766A0" spacingbefore="6" keepwithnext="True">4.3 Dead loads</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="W_cap = If(V_cap &gt; 0 ft^3, V_cap, b_cap*h_cap*L_cap)*w_c to kip" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>W_cap = If(V_cap &gt; 0 ft^3, V_cap, b_cap*h_cap*L_cap)*w_c to kip</expbody>
        <expresult> = 29.494 kip</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">cap</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="W_ped = N_brg*L_ped*B_ped*h_ped*w_c to kip" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>W_ped = N_brg*L_ped*B_ped*h_ped*w_c to kip</expbody>
        <expresult> = 1.312 kip</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">pedestals</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="W_bw = t_bw*H_bw_avg*L_bw*w_c to kip" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>W_bw = t_bw*H_bw_avg*L_bw*w_c to kip</expbody>
        <expresult> = 11.665 kip</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">backwall</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="W_ck = If(V_ck &gt; 0 ft^3, V_ck, 2*t_ck*w_ck*H_ck)*w_c to kip" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>W_ck = If(V_ck &gt; 0 ft^3, V_ck, 2*t_ck*w_ck*H_ck)*w_c to kip</expbody>
        <expresult> = 6.447 kip</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">cheek walls, both</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="w_sl_DC = share_slab*L_slab*t_slab*w_c to klf" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>w_sl_DC = share_slab*L_slab*t_slab*w_c to klf</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.429 klf</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">slab DC on the backwall (gravity only)</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="w_sl_PL = share_slab*L_slab*q_PL to klf" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>w_sl_PL = share_slab*L_slab*q_PL to klf</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.772 klf</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">slab PL on the backwall (gravity only)</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="14" spacingafter="6" fontweight="bold" textcolor="#1766A0" spacingbefore="8" keepwithnext="True">5. Overturning about the pile top and tie-back force</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="6">Each quantity below is written for the five combinations in this order: Service I, Strength I, Strength III wind 1, Strength III wind 2, Strength IV (LRFD Tables 3.4.1-1 and 3.4.1-2). TU and SH share one factor. Wind takes γWS = 1.0 where it applies; vertical wind counts only when it increases overturning. The equations are shown for Service I, the other combinations repeat them in the collapsed sections, and the values of all five appear side by side in the green tables.</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="3" fontweight="bold" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">Load factors γ for the five combinations</paragraph>
    <embed spacingbefore="5" spacingafter="8">
      <table name="GammaFactors" capture="False" colwidths="1:110, 2:100, 3:100, 4:100, 5:100, 6:100">
        <stylerule range="A1:F8" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" valueformat="RoundedNumber(3, 3, {PriorityUnits: []})" border="Border(&quot;AllSides&quot;, &quot;Solid&quot;, 0.6, &quot;#A78638&quot;); Border(&quot;BetweenRows&quot;, &quot;Solid&quot;, 0.4, &quot;#A78638&quot;);"/>
        <stylerule range="A1:F1" horzalign="Center" vertalign="Center"/>
        <stylerule range="B2:F8" horzalign="Center" vertalign="Center"/>
        <row>
          <textcell name="GammaFactorsR0C0" capture="False" background="#F7E6B9">
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="0" fontweight="bold" horzalign="Center">Factor</paragraph>
          </textcell>
          <textcell name="GammaFactorsR0C1" capture="False" background="#F7E6B9">
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="0" fontweight="bold" horzalign="Center">Service I</paragraph>
          </textcell>
          <textcell name="GammaFactorsR0C2" capture="False" background="#F7E6B9">
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="0" fontweight="bold" horzalign="Center">Strength I</paragraph>
          </textcell>
          <textcell name="GammaFactorsR0C3" capture="False" background="#F7E6B9">
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="0" fontweight="bold" horzalign="Center">Strength III · wind 1</paragraph>
          </textcell>
          <textcell name="GammaFactorsR0C4" capture="False" background="#F7E6B9">
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="0" fontweight="bold" horzalign="Center">Strength III · wind 2</paragraph>
          </textcell>
          <textcell name="GammaFactorsR0C5" capture="False" background="#F7E6B9">
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="0" fontweight="bold" horzalign="Center">Strength IV</paragraph>
          </textcell>
        </row>
        <row>
          <textcell name="GammaFactorsR1C0" capture="False" background="#FFF8E9">
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="0">γ_EH</paragraph>
