    </embed>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Stations k = 0 to 7 are X_T_0 to X_T_7; combinations r are the four strength combinations (Strength I, Strength III wind 1, Strength III wind 2, Strength IV). The equations are shown for station 0 and Strength I; the other 62 values sit in the collapsed section and the green table lists the larger of T_A and T_B at each station.</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="T_A_0_STRI = Abs(T_c_STRI(X_T_0)) to kip*ft" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>T_A_0_STRI = Abs(T_c_STRI(X_T_0)) to kip*ft</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.000 kip*ft</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">torque at each station</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="T_B_0_STRI = Abs(T_c_STRI(X_T_0 - (0.001 in))) to kip*ft" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
