      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">torque just before each station</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">The other 62 station and combination values of T_A and T_B: the same equations, collapsed.</paragraph>
