    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Figure 3. Demand/capacity ratio of each check (stems, numbered as in the Summary table) against the 1.0 limit. The stems are live formulas of the check ratios: a stem turns red when its ratio passes 1.0.</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="12" spacingafter="6" fontweight="bold" textcolor="#1766A0" spacingbefore="6" keepwithnext="True">Tie-back loads for the plans (SDM 12.3.F)</paragraph>
    <embed spacingbefore="5" spacingafter="8">
      <table name="PlanLoads" capture="False" colwidths="1:420, 2:120">
        <stylerule range="A1:B3" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" valueformat="RoundedNumber(3, 3, {PriorityUnits: []})" border="Border(&quot;AllSides&quot;, &quot;Solid&quot;, 0.6, &quot;#6A9075&quot;); Border(&quot;BetweenRows&quot;, &quot;Solid&quot;, 0.4, &quot;#6A9075&quot;);"/>
        <stylerule range="A1:B1" horzalign="Center" vertalign="Center"/>
        <stylerule range="B2:B3" horzalign="Center" vertalign="Center"/>
        <row>
          <textcell name="PlanLoadsR0C0" capture="False" background="#DCECE0">
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="0" fontweight="bold" horzalign="Center">Tie-back load</paragraph>
          </textcell>
          <textcell name="PlanLoadsR0C1" capture="False" background="#DCECE0">
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="0" fontweight="bold" horzalign="Center">Value</paragraph>
          </textcell>
        </row>
        <row>
          <textcell name="PlanLoadsR1C0" capture="False" background="#EFF7F1">
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="0">service load per foot of backwall, f_str_s (klf)</paragraph>
          </textcell>
          <c formula="f_str_s to klf" capture="False" background="#EFF7F1">
            <num>3.089 klf</num>
          </c>
        </row>
        <row>
          <textcell name="PlanLoadsR2C0" capture="False" background="#EFF7F1">
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="0">factored load per foot of backwall, f_str_u (klf)</paragraph>
          </textcell>
          <c formula="f_str_u to klf" capture="False" background="#EFF7F1">
            <num>3.737 klf</num>
          </c>
        </row>
      </table>
    </embed>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Plan note (SDM 12.3.F): "The soil reinforcement attached to the backwall shall be designed by a Specialty Engineer for the service and factored loads as shown using the design criteria for permanent MSE walls. Cost of furnishing and installing the soil reinforcement is considered incidental to the cost of the end bent." Also add the SDG 1.15 note requiring the construction joints to be intentionally roughened to a 1/4 in amplitude.</paragraph>
